  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNAMID. AFRICAN UNION - UNITED NATIONS HYBRID OPERATION IN DARFUR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNAMID had the protection of civilians as its core mandate, but was also tasked with contributing to security for humanitarian assistance, monitoring and verifying implementation of agreements, assisting an inclusive political process, contributing to the promotion of human rights and the rule of law, and monitoring and reporting on the situation along the borders with Chad and the Central African Republic (CAR).

UNAMID ended its activities on 31 December 2020.</narrative>
  </description>
